   "value": "n = 2;\nJ = {{1, 0, 0}, {0, -1, 0}, {0, 0, 1}};\nS[k_] := J + {{m[k]},{1},{l m[k] x[k]}} .  {{-2 l m[k] x[k], 2, 2m[k]}};\nStot = Fold[Dot, S[#] & /@ Range[n, 1, -1]];\nFix[x_] := Simplify[Expand[x]];\nconstS = Fix[Tr[J.Stot]];\nCollect[Fix[constS], l, Simplify]\n(* A[i_,j_] := l m[i] m[j] (x[j] - x[i]);\nconst = 3 - 2 - 2 - 2 - 4((1 + A[3,2])(-1+A[3,2]) + (1 + A[3,1])(-1 + A[3,1]) + (1 + A[2,1])(-1 + A[2,1])) - 8(1+A[2,1])(1+A[3,2])(1+A[3,1]);\nCollect[Fix[const], l, Simplify]\nSimplify[Expand[dot[constS]]] *)",
